  "solution": "Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math> lần lượt là biến cố động cơ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>I</mi></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow></semantics></math> chạy tốt.<br>Khi đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mi>A</mi><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Gọi biến cố <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>C</mi></semantics></math>: ““ Có ít nhất một động cơ chạy tốt””.<b